Changes & Voting Matters","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0001090727/000110465925048497/tm2514602d6_8k.htm"},{"d":"2025-05-12","type":"8-K","title":"Corporate Changes & Voting Matters","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0001090727/000109072725000051/ups-20250508.htm"},{"d":"2025-05-07","type":"10-Q","title":"Periodic Financial Reports","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0001090727/000109072725000049/ups-20250331.htm"},{"d":"2025-04-29","type":"8-K","title":"Corporate Changes & Voting Matters","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0001090727/000109072725000046/ups-20250429.htm"},{"d":"2025-04-02","type":"S-3/A","title":"Offering Registrations","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0001090727/000110465925031229/tm2510678d1_s3a.htm"}],"wiki":{"en":{"t":"United Parcel Service","x":"United Parcel Service, Inc. (UPS) is an American multinational shipping-and-receiving and supply chain management company founded in 1907. Originally known as the American Messenger Company specializing in telegraphs, UPS has expanded to become a Fortune 500 company and one of the world's largest shipping couriers. UPS today is primarily known for its ground shipping services as well as the UPS Store, a retail chain which assists UPS shipments and provides tools for small businesses. UPS offers air shipping on an overnight or two-day basis and delivers to post office boxes through UPS Mail Innovations and UPS Ground Saver.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Parcel_Service"},"ru":{"t":"United Parcel Service","x":"United Parcel Service, Inc., или UPS — американская компания, специализирующаяся на экспресс-доставке и логистике. Штаб-квартира компании расположена в Атланте. Крупнейшим клиентом является компания Amazon, на неё в 2022 году пришлось 11,3 % выручки UPS.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Parcel_Service"}},"wiki_at":"2026-10-22T15:29:40.400030+00:00"}